Just two months until the **Putumayo Loop on October 18**! Time flies, and it's wonderful to see how the sports energy in **Hulst** is building. Preparations are in full swing, and behind the scenes, everyone is working hard to make it an amazing day together.

## Meet us at the Pagadder Run!

This Saturday, **August 29**, Hulst hosts the [5e Pagadder Run-Bike-Walk](https://www.inulst.nl/evenement/5e-pagadder-run-bike-walk). Quina Care won't be running or cycling, but we'll definitely be there with a friendly **information stand**!

Please stop by for a chat. We'd love to tell you more about Quina Care's mission and the work we do. And if you're inspired? You can sign up for the Putumayo Loop in Hulst right at our stand!

We look forward to meeting you and working together on this wonderful initiative.

![Putumayo Loop Flyer](/img/events/putumayo-loop-2026/flyer.jpg)

## Hulst is ready!

Hulst is an incredibly important hub for us, and the community spirit is truly felt. Involvement grows every day. Whether you're running, sponsoring a runner, or sharing our story with friends and family — together we make a difference!

Have you got your running shoes ready? You can choose from the **10 km**, **21 km**, or go for the ultimate challenge of the **full marathon**?

![Route 10 km](/img/events/putumayo-loop-2026/route-10km.png)

![Route 21 km](/img/events/putumayo-loop-2026/route-21km.png)

## More information and sign up

Want to read all the details and local information? Check out the [Inulst event page](https://www.inulst.nl/evenement/1433-putymayoloophulst).

**See you this Saturday, August 29 in Hulst!**

